[$in title:Browser behaviour]
[$in description:Separate static HTML from runtime DOM operations and future typed event delivery.]
[$in head:[language_theme_head]]

[navbar]
[sidebar]
init_docs_sidebar()!

[section, $md:
    # Browser behaviour

    Static components describe the page. Ordinary runtime functions
    interact with the live browser. Moth's intended DOM and Events
    packages make that separation explicit, while keeping application
    logic in Moth rather than handwritten JavaScript.

    The synchronous `@web/dom` package and the later event-to-Channel
    bridge are future design. See the @../../progress (progress matrix)
    for current capabilities.
]

[section:
